uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823837_1865304528160141_1123951631854761529_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dPeu_Vu_p_4Q7kNvwHZR1_y&_nc_oc=AdoRkL1x9QHu0Hjo9YbNEHvep5RdFp_OAlEY8325uuEvpnF0KYzyDqTMOkXGwtzAmVs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXMHm2zX0sCR1HAZauVC7-EeJ0PPSHUB7kRbDzVgK4RdQ&oe=6B0EFFDF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Visa Desk Simulator", "keywords": ["simulation", "puzzle", "narrative", "paperwork", "seated"], "long_description": "You're the new officer at Booth 3 of a Schengen visa section. The queue is long, the rules are real, and every applicant has somewhere they need to be.\n\nPick up the passport, the form and the papers they slide under the glass. Tap two fields and a thread shows whether they match. Compare the photo with the face at the window, check the dates, the money and the insurance, then stamp GRANTED, REFUSED or RETURNED and tick the reason.\n\nWHAT'S INSIDE\n- Twelve days in Istanbul, Dubai and Mumbai, with new rules each morning\n- Real Visa Code checks: passport validity, funds, insurance, the 90/180-day rule, the right consulate, records and alerts on the VIS/SIS terminal\n- Forgeries to catch: code lines that don't match, missing UV print, fake micro-print, the wrong perforated number, ink that doesn't shift\n- People with tempers: chatty, nervous, short-tempered. They knock on the glass, and some come back with the paper they forgot\n- A day full of surprises: power cuts, queue-jumpers, a fixer in the hall, a pigeon, the Consul watching over your shoulder, and a phone that rings at the worst moment\n- Envelopes of cash, Ministry quotas and favours for the Consul, and a family back home\n- Rank up, earn your nameplate, and spend your savings on your booth\n- Seven endings, replays, a Daily Shift and an Endless queue\n\nEvery person, bank, hotel and airline is made up; the countries, money and rules are real. Made for seated play, with hands or controllers. No ads, no subscriptions.", "short_description": "Stamp passports at a Schengen visa window. Read the papers, look at the person behind the glass, and decide: grant, refuse, or send them back. The rules are the EU Visa Code's, the fakes are caught with a UV lamp and a magnifier, and the people argue, plead, fret, and come back with the paper they forgot. Twelve days in Istanbul, Dubai and Mumbai, seven endings, a Daily Shift and an Endless queue. Played seated, with hands or controllers."}]}, "developer_name": "Navid Mirzaaghazadeh", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://navid.tr/apps/visadesk/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Nav Mirza Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://navid.tr/apps/visadesk", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1402224766303989"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1723724012804835"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2339909086546461"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2339909086546461"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1797271200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1723724012804835"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "140226093296703